  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/document/your-guide-employment-standards-act-0/overtime-pay" rel="noopener">Ontario — Your guide to the Employment Standards Act: Overtime pay</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/document/your-guide-employment-standards-act-0/hours-work" rel="noopener">Ontario — Your guide to the Employment Standards Act: Hours of work and eating periods</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/L-2/" rel="noopener">Canada Labour Code, Part III — standard hours and overtime for federally regulated workplaces</a></li>
  </ul>
</GuideLayout>
